{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 5,
  "name": "水天需",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00672",
              "text": "需。有孚，光亨，贞吉。利涉大川。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00672",
                "bodyParagraph": 608
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00673",
              "text": "象曰：云上于天，需；君子以饮食宴乐。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00673",
                "bodyParagraph": 609
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00675",
              "text": "需卦：抓到俘虏。大吉大利，吉利的卜问。有利于涉水渡河。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00675",
                "bodyParagraph": 611
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00676",
              "text": "《象辞》说：需的上卦为坎，表示云；下卦为乾，表示天。云浮聚于天上，待时降雨是需卦的卦象。君子观此卦象，可以宴饮安乐，待时而动。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00676",
                "bodyParagraph": 612
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "《断易天机》解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00678",
              "text": "需卦坎上乾下，为坤宫游魂卦。需为踌躇、期待，虽然刚强，但前面有险阻，应当等待，涉大川则利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00678",
                "bodyParagraph": 614
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00680",
              "text": "坎陷当前，遇阻不进；大器晚成，收成在后。 得此卦者，时机尚未成熟，需要耐心等待，急进反会见凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00680",
                "bodyParagraph": 616
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00682",
              "text": "时运：时机尚未成熟，耐心等待。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00682",
                "bodyParagraph": 618
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00683",
              "text": "财运：资本未集，无法开张。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00683",
                "bodyParagraph": 619
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00684",
              "text": "家宅：平安是福。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00684",
                "bodyParagraph": 620
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00685",
              "text": "身体：调节饮食，健康有望。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00685",
                "bodyParagraph": 621
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "传统解卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00687",
              "text": "这个卦是异卦（下乾上坎）相叠，下卦是乾，刚健之意；上卦是坎，险陷之意。以刚逢险，宜稳健之妥，不可冒失行动，观时待变，所往一定成功。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00687",
                "bodyParagraph": 623
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00688",
              "text": "大象：云登天上而未雨，不能急进，等待时机之象。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00688",
                "bodyParagraph": 624
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00689",
              "text": "运势：智者必须待时而行，急进反见凶险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00689",
                "bodyParagraph": 625
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00690",
              "text": "事业：关键在于审时度势，耐心等待，事成于安祥，切勿冒险，欲速不达。自己要充满自信，临危不惧，坚守中正，必可化险为夷。情况有利时，仍得居安思危。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00690",
                "bodyParagraph": 626
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00691",
              "text": "经商：行动之初，情况困难，必须以极大的耐心，创造条件和机会，行事光明磊落，观时待变，实现愿望。事情接近成功时，更应小心谨慎，切莫功亏一篑。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00691",
                "bodyParagraph": 627
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00692",
              "text": "求名：时机尚不成熟，应耐心等待。这时应坚定信念，不为闲言流语所动摇，努力丰富自己，再求助可靠的人便可成功。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00692",
                "bodyParagraph": 628
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00693",
              "text": "婚恋：慎重，切不可草率行事，逐渐培养感情，以诚实、热情相待，会发生变故，仍可以有良好的结局。双方都应懂得以柔克刚的道理。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00693",
                "bodyParagraph": 629
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00694",
              "text": "决策：前途光明，有雄心大志，且可实现。为此需要积蓄实力，等待时机，大器晚成。本人具有坚强的意志，冷静的头脑。前进途中会遇到困难和险阻，必须十分谨慎，坦然对待小人的中伤，在灾祸在面前能镇静自若。不轻举妄动，冷静选择方向。为人谦和、坦率，多有他人相助，促使事业成功。当时机成熟后，必然一帆风顺。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00694",
                "bodyParagraph": 630
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00696",
              "text": "需卦，本卦是异卦相叠，上卦为坎，下卦为乾。乾卦象征天空辽阔，坎卦象征乌云密布。雨水之于传统农业社会而言，是最大的需求，因此用这个意象来表现。古人引申为雨将下，万物皆待，所以叫需。需，古体字结构是“雨上天下”，从雨而声。如苍天下雨，滋养万物及人。从人的角度看，天下雨，则不易出行耕作，因此在家喝酒吃肉、静待天时。所以，这一卦的基本象征就是等待、不进，还有饮食之义。需卦位于蒙卦之后，《序卦》之中这样解释道：“物稚不可不养也，故受之以需。需者，饮食之道也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00696",
                "bodyParagraph": 632
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00697",
              "text": "”有所需要，也是有所等待。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00697",
                "bodyParagraph": 633
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00698",
              "text": "《象》曰：云上于天，需;君子以饮食宴乐。 民间卦象诗中这段话的意思是说：需卦的卦象是乾(天)下坎(水)上，为水在天上之表象。水汽聚集天上成为云层，密云満天，但还没有下雨，需要等待;君子在这个时候需要吃喝，饮酒作乐，即在等待的时候积蓄力量。 需卦象征等待，启示人们守正待机的道理，属于中上卦。民间卦象诗对此卦的描述：明珠土埋日久深，无光无亮到如今，忽然大风吹土去，自然显露有重新。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00698",
                "bodyParagraph": 634
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0009",
                "detail-edit-0010"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00701",
              "text": "初九。需于郊，利用恒，无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00701",
                "bodyParagraph": 637
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00702",
              "text": "象曰：需于郊，不犯难行也；利用恒，无咎，未失常也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00702",
                "bodyParagraph": 638
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00704",
              "text": "初九：在郊外等侯，应该照旧等待下去，没有危险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00704",
                "bodyParagraph": 640
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00705",
              "text": "《象辞》说：在郊外等候，是说不能冒险前进。照旧等待下去，没有危险，这是因为待机而动没有违反正常的原则。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00705",
                "bodyParagraph": 641
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00707",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，宜守旧，则无灾祸。做官的须守常职，耐心等待机会。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00707",
                "bodyParagraph": 643
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00709",
              "text": "时运：必须久待，守恒为要。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00709",
                "bodyParagraph": 645
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00710",
              "text": "财运：暂勿投资，货物无损。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00710",
                "bodyParagraph": 646
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00711",
              "text": "家宅：可居郊外。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00711",
                "bodyParagraph": 647
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00712",
              "text": "身体：幽居养病，终无大碍。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00712",
                "bodyParagraph": 648
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00714",
              "text": "初九爻动变得周易第48卦：水风井。这个卦是异卦（下巽上坎）相叠。坎为水；巽为木。树木得水而蓬勃生长。人靠水井生活，水井由人挖掘而成。相互为养，井以水养人，经久不竭，人应取此德而勤劳自勉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00714",
                "bodyParagraph": 650
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00716",
              "text": "初九：需于郊。利用恒，无咎。爻辞释义 郊：指郊外。初九这一爻选离坎卦，就像远离市中心的郊外一样。从卦象上看，初九以阳爻居于刚位，得位。其远离上卦坎，也意味着远离危险，所以说是“需于郊”。但是阳爻具有好动、冒进的特性，但是其与九二逆比，必受九二的阻拦，会招来灾祸，所以最好办法就是静等时机。占得此爻者，现在不宜采取任何行动，应耐心地等待。如果你缺乏耐心，贸然行动，可能就会铸成大错。等待是很考验人的耐心的，有些人就是因为缺乏耐心，从而错失了机会。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00716",
                "bodyParagraph": 652
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00717",
              "text": "有个人到海上出行，不幸乘坐的船遇难，同船的人都被淹死了，他因为奋力地抱住了一根木头，总算保住了性命，漂到了一个小岛上。刚开始时，他满怀信心，等待有船路过，来搭救他。可是等了一个月之后，他再也等不下去了，于是自己用木头搭建筏子，打算过海，可是半路却被淹死了。等待需要耐心和恒心，占得此卦者，要注意这一点。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00717",
                "bodyParagraph": 653
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "九二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00720",
              "text": "九二。需于沙，小有言，终吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00720",
                "bodyParagraph": 656
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00721",
              "text": "象曰：需于沙，衍在中也；虽小有言，以终吉也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00721",
                "bodyParagraph": 657
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00723",
              "text": "九二：在沙地上等待，稍微有过错，最后还是吉利的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00723",
                "bodyParagraph": 659
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00724",
              "text": "《象辞》说：在沙地上等待，沙地软柔难通行，将有延误事机之失，这过失在自身。虽然稍微有过错，最后的结果还是好的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00724",
                "bodyParagraph": 660
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00726",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，会受到争诉之扰，若能以宽厚待人，则不辩自明。做官的会受到流言的困扰，但最后吉祥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00726",
                "bodyParagraph": 662
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00728",
              "text": "时运：流言困阻，最后吉祥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00728",
                "bodyParagraph": 664
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00729",
              "text": "财运：货运不通，无害商业。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00729",
                "bodyParagraph": 665
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00730",
              "text": "家宅：口舌之争。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00730",
                "bodyParagraph": 666
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00731",
              "text": "身体：心胸宽大，自然吉祥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00731",
                "bodyParagraph": 667
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00733",
              "text": "九二爻动变得周易第63卦：水火既济。这个卦是异卦（下离上坎）相叠。坎为水，离为火，水火相交，水在火上，水势压倒火势，救火大功告成。既，已经；济，成也。既济就是事情已经成功，但终将发生变故。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00733",
                "bodyParagraph": 669
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00735",
              "text": "九二：需于沙，小有言，终吉。爻辞释义 需于沙：待在沙滩之意。小有言：受别人责难。此爻的意思说：此时有若处于沙滩之中，虽然遭到别人的责难，但这也无大碍，只要坚持，最终能吉利。从卦象上看，九二以阳爻居于阴位，又得中位，象征刚柔相济善于忍让的君子。九二与九五敌应，与一个卦之中的主要领导为敌，日子必然不好过。但是九二、九三、六四组成了兑卦，兑为喜悦、光明之意，象征着九二会迎来喜悦和光明的日子，只是现在要静等时机，并且忍受别人的闲言碎语。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00735",
                "bodyParagraph": 671
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00736",
              "text": "占得此爻者，还应该继续耐心等待，光明很快就会到来。有人要是讽刺你、挖苦你、指责你，也不要放在心上，不去理会他们。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00736",
                "bodyParagraph": 672
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "九三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00739",
              "text": "九三。需于泥，致寇至。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00739",
                "bodyParagraph": 675
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00740",
              "text": "象曰：需于泥，灾在外也。自我致寇，敬慎不败也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00740",
                "bodyParagraph": 676
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00742",
              "text": "九三：在泥淖中等待，把强盗招引过来。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00742",
                "bodyParagraph": 678
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00743",
              "text": "《象辞》说：在泥淖中等待，泥淖污秽，环境险恶，灾难就在附近。由自己招致了强盗，但郑重谨慎，随机应变，就可不受损伤。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00743",
                "bodyParagraph": 679
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00745",
              "text": "凶：得此爻者，须防止窃盗之患，亦要预防水险。做官的会被贬职。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00745",
                "bodyParagraph": 681
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00747",
              "text": "时运：难期上达，谨慎自持。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00747",
                "bodyParagraph": 683
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00748",
              "text": "财运：无法流通，小心受骗。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00748",
                "bodyParagraph": 684
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00749",
              "text": "家宅：婚事难成，成则怨偶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00749",
                "bodyParagraph": 685
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00750",
              "text": "身体：小心外伤。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00750",
                "bodyParagraph": 686
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00752",
              "text": "九三爻动变得周易第60卦：水泽节。这个卦是异卦（下兑上坎）相叠。兑为泽，坎为水。泽有水而流有限，多必溢于泽外。因此要有节度，故称节。节卦与涣卦相反，互为综卦，交相使用。天地有节度才能常新，国家有节度才能安稳，个人有节度才能完美。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00752",
                "bodyParagraph": 688
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00754",
              "text": "九三：需于泥，致宼至。爻辞释义 需于泥：待在泥泽中。 致宼至：招致贼宼的进犯。 此爻的意思是：在泥沼中等待，招来了强盗。 从卦象上看，九三这一爻居下卦之上，紧邻坎水，等于停留在河边的泥沼之中。坎是盗、是险之意，如果继续行动，就会陷入泥沼之中，引来强盗，因为强盗离得不远了。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00754",
                "bodyParagraph": 690
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00755",
              "text": "象曰：需于泥，灾在外也。自我致宼，敬慎不败也。 这句话的意思是说：在泥沼中等待，是因为外面有强盗。由自己招来的强盗，只要恭敬谨慎就不会陷于祸败。 需卦是上坎下乾，乾卦是刚健有力的。占得此爻者，如果做事急躁冒进，就会陷入危险之中。但是，如要恭敬谨慎，就能自保，可立于不败之地。 停留在淤泥中，在淤泥中求食物，处境可就不是很好了。九三爻的上面是坎卦，坎含有贼寇的意思，所以“需于泥”的九三会招致贼寇的侵犯。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00755",
                "bodyParagraph": 691
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "六四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00758",
              "text": "六四。需于血，出自穴。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00758",
                "bodyParagraph": 694
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00759",
              "text": "象曰：需于血，顺以听也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00759",
                "bodyParagraph": 695
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00761",
              "text": "六四：起初在血泊中滞留，后来从凶险的陷阱中逃脱出来。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00761",
                "bodyParagraph": 697
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00762",
              "text": "《象辞》说：在血泊中滞留，坐等不测的命运降临，六四之爻处在九五之爻的威逼之下，只得顺从强者，听从摆布。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00762",
                "bodyParagraph": 698
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00764",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，坏运逐渐远离，恢复平静。做官的能全身而退。从事国学者可出身成名。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00764",
                "bodyParagraph": 700
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00766",
              "text": "时运：用尽心力才可出头。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00766",
                "bodyParagraph": 702
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00767",
              "text": "财运：投资矿业，有利可图。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00767",
                "bodyParagraph": 703
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00768",
              "text": "家宅：乔迁之喜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00768",
                "bodyParagraph": 704
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00769",
              "text": "身体：调养气血，和顺阴阳。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00769",
                "bodyParagraph": 705
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00771",
              "text": "六四爻动变得周易第43卦：泽天夬。这个卦是异卦（下乾上兑）相叠。乾为天为健；兑为泽为悦。泽气上升，决注成雨，雨施大地，滋润万物。五阳去一阴，去之不难，决（去之意）即可，故名为夬（guài），夬即决。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00771",
                "bodyParagraph": 707
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00773",
              "text": "六四：需于血，出自穴。爻辞释义 需于血：坎卦为血，六四处于此卦之中，而且它下面的三个都是阳爻，会发生阴阳之战，会见血。出自穴：坎卦还象征着沟渎，代指陷阱或地下之穴。“出自穴”表示逃出洞穴。需卦是等待的意思，但是在等待的过程中，也要看具体的情况，陷入血泊之中，就应该想办法从凶险中逃脱出来。这时如果还在坐着等待，那就有些愚笨了。遇到特殊情况，就不要坐等噩运的降临。六四属于阴爻，不妨听从强者，依附于强者，顺应客观规律，这样才能化险为夷。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00773",
                "bodyParagraph": 709
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00774",
              "text": "好在六四为人谦和，人缘不错， 下与初九有应，又与九三亲比，上承九五之君的帮助，因此能化险为夷。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00774",
                "bodyParagraph": 710
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "九五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00777",
              "text": "九五。需于酒食，贞吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00777",
                "bodyParagraph": 713
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00778",
              "text": "象曰：酒食贞吉，以中正也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00778",
                "bodyParagraph": 714
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00780",
              "text": "九五：在酒宴上等待，这是吉利的占兆。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00780",
                "bodyParagraph": 716
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00781",
              "text": "《象辞》说：有酒有肉，吉利之兆，因为九五之爻处于上卦中位，象征其人有中正的品德，自能择善而居，处优容之境。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00781",
                "bodyParagraph": 717
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00783",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，会物产丰富，衣食不缺，也会有婚嫁之喜。做官的食禄会丰厚。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00783",
                "bodyParagraph": 719
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00785",
              "text": "时运：功成名就，可以宴乐。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00785",
                "bodyParagraph": 721
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00786",
              "text": "财运：投资饮食业，可获利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00786",
                "bodyParagraph": 722
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00787",
              "text": "家宅：婚嫁得宜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00787",
                "bodyParagraph": 723
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00788",
              "text": "身体：饮食调理。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00788",
                "bodyParagraph": 724
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00790",
              "text": "九五爻动变得周易第11卦：地天泰。这个卦是异卦（下乾上坤）相叠，乾为天，为阳；坤为地，为阴，阴阳交感，上下互通，天地相交，万物纷纭。反之则凶，万事万物，皆对立，转化，盛极必衰，衰而转盛，故应时而变者泰（通）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00790",
                "bodyParagraph": 726
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00792",
              "text": "九五：需于酒食，贞吉。爻辞释义 爻辞的意思是：在享用酒食中等待，正固吉祥。九五这一爻，是需卦的主爻，以阳爻居于君位，得位持中。等待是让人焦急的，尤其是处于危险或迷茫之中，前途未卜之时，许多人会吃不下睡不着，整天忧心忡忡，甚至惶恐不安。九五爻则代表人的一种胸怀和境界，处于危难之中，仍旧品尝着酒食，自得其乐。占得此卦的人，可能最近会出席酒宴，可以保持一颗纯正的心去参加，会通过酒宴达到目的，结局很吉祥。九五居干君王之位，自然可以享受酒食之乐了。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00792",
                "bodyParagraph": 728
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00793",
              "text": "可是必须守正道才会吉祥。古代的帝王们，大多数是因为酒食之乐逐渐走向堕落和腐败的。比如封王，刚登基时是一位极其贤明的天子，可是后来做了一双象牙筷子，干是由一双象牙筷子发展到了酒池肉林，最后越来越奢侈，终于导致了国家的灭亡。所以说，酒食之乐要建立在正道的基础上才会吉祥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00793",
                "bodyParagraph": 729
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00796",
              "text": "上六。入于穴，有不速之客三人来，敬之终吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00796",
                "bodyParagraph": 732
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00797",
              "text": "象曰：不速之客，敬之终吉；虽不当位，未大失也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00797",
                "bodyParagraph": 733
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00799",
              "text": "上六：进入地穴式的房屋，有三位不速之客来到，恭敬地接待他们，结果是吉利的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00799",
                "bodyParagraph": 735
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00800",
              "text": "《象辞》说：不速之客来了，恭敬地接待他们，结果是吉利的。因为全卦阳刚过甚，逼压阴柔，但是上六处阴位，位置合适，所以有惊无险，没有大的损失。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00800",
                "bodyParagraph": 736
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00802",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，宜谨慎，则忧愁自散。做官的会有升迁之机会，但须防谗邪之流。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00802",
                "bodyParagraph": 738
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00804",
              "text": "时运：凭险自守，和解为贵。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00804",
                "bodyParagraph": 740
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00805",
              "text": "财运：得价则售，不可贮藏。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00805",
                "bodyParagraph": 741
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00806",
              "text": "家宅：持家有道；少男乃吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00806",
                "bodyParagraph": 742
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00807",
              "text": "身体：病况凶险，不存侥幸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00807",
                "bodyParagraph": 743
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00809",
              "text": "上六爻动变得周易第9卦：风天小畜。这个卦是异卦（下乾上巽）相叠，乾为天，巽为风。喻风调雨顺，谷物滋长，故卦名小畜（蓄）。力量有限，须待发展到一定程度，才可大有作为。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00809",
                "bodyParagraph": 745
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00811",
              "text": "上六：入于穴，有不速之客三人来;敬之，终吉。爻辞释义 不速之客：是指不召自来的客人。三人：古代以三喻多，这里指多人。这一爻的意思就是：进入洞穴之中，有多位不请自来的客人，尊敬他们，结局会很吉祥。上六的位置是在坎卦的上爻，坎卦代表洞穴。上六则代表着进入了洞穴。上六是阴爻，而上这一位置是柔位，所以上六属于得位，可以安居于此。爻辞“入干穴”，也是根据变卦而来的。大壮卦上卦为震为雷，没有“穴”的含义，可是变为需卦后，上卦为坎，坎有“穴”的含义。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00811",
                "bodyParagraph": 747
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00812",
              "text": "上六于是有“入于穴”的形象了。“不速之客三人”指的便是下卦的三个阳爻，这三个阳爻以刚健之德跋涉大川，大川便是上面的坎卦，所以上六会遇到这三个不速之客。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00812",
                "bodyParagraph": 748
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 0
}
